                                    Shen works based on multimodal approach
                                </h2>
                            </div>
                            <div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div>
                            <div class="scientific-hybrit_block">
                                <div class="scientific-hybrit_block-grid">
                                    <div class="scientific-hybrit_block-item">
                                        <div class="scientific-hybrit_video-wrapper">
                                            <img
                                                src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/6809018eb33b9d9caf5064ba_video_flow72250_-ezgif.com-resize.gif"
                                                loading="lazy"
                                                alt="Woman with long curly hair and green top, with digital mesh overlay on her face representing facial recognition technology."
                                                class="scientific-hybrit_video is-gif"
                                            />
                                        </div>
                                        <h3 class="h3-30">Remote Photoplethysmography</h3>
                                        <p class="text-size-regular">
                                            ihealthy utilizes remote photoplethysmography (rPPG) to extract vital health
                                            data from a simple video recording. By analyzing subtle color changes in the
                                            skin caused by blood flow, ihealthy can measure heart rate, respiratory rate,
                                            and other key vitals—all without the need for physical sensors. This
                                            AI-driven technology ensures accurate, contactless health monitoring, making
                                            it easy for users to check their health anytime, anywhere, using just their
                                            device’s camera.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="scientific-hybrit_block-item">
                                        <div class="scientific-hybrit_video-wrapper">
                                            <img
                                                src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/6809018e1847f228b4fc2493_video_dd_novectors72250-ezgif.com-resize.gif"
                                                loading="lazy"
                                                alt="Woman with long curly hair wearing a green top looking directly at the camera with a neutral expression."
                                                class="scientific-hybrit_video is-gif"
                                            />
                                        </div>
                                        <h3 class="h3-30">Remote Ballistocardiography</h3>
                                        <p class="text-size-regular">
                                            ihealthy leverages remote Ballistocardiography (rBCG) to analyze tiny face
                                            movements caused by the heart’s mechanical activity. Using a device’s
                                            camera, rBCG detects subtle vibrations and micro-motions to estimate heart
                                            rate, cardiac output, and other vital parameters without physical contact.
                                            This advanced AI-driven approach enables seamless, non-invasive heart health
                                            monitoring, making it accessible anytime, anywhere.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
